{"text": "Then someone in the crowd called out. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I think it is General Zhigalovs dog. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> General Zhigalovs, Hmm. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Yeldyrin, help me off with my coat. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> For it is terribly hot today. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But one thing I cannot understand. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Is how it could ever reach your finger. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It is such a little dog. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And you are such a big, tall man. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You must have scratched your finger. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On a nail and then you got the idea. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Of asking for money. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I know you people very well. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You rascals. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He pushed a lit cigarette. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Into her face as a joke, sir. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And she was clever enough. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To snap at him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said another man in the crowd. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That is a lie, cried Khryukin. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> His honor is a wise man. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Who knows who is lying. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And who is telling the truth. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And let me tell you. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> My own brother is in the police too. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Stop arguing, both of you. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Ochumelov ordered sharply.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", "n", " ", "s", "o", "m", "e", "o", "n", "e", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "c", "r", "o", "w", "d", " ", "c", "a", "l", "l", "e", "d", " ", "o", "u", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", " ", "t", "h", "i", "n", "k", " ", "i", "t", " ", "i", "s", " ", "G", "e", "n", "e", "r", "a", "l", " ", "Z", "h", "i", "g", "a", "l", "o", "v", "s", " ", "d", "o", "g", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=",